Right? Yeah, when I said "I like you", it's far.

293
00:26:50,830 --> 00:26:53,430
いや とっても 可愛いカップル
No, such a cute couple.

294
00:26:53,430 --> 00:26:56,030
よかったですね 皆さん ね ありがとうございます
I'm glad for you guys. Thank you very much.

295
00:26:56,030 --> 00:26:57,610
ね コメントでサザエって言われてるよ
Hey, people in the comments are calling it "Sazae".

296
00:26:57,610 --> 00:27:02,530
サザエさんってみんな違う! みんなファミリーになろうよ じゃ
Sazae-san? Everyone's wrong! Let's all become a family, then.

297
00:27:02,530 --> 00:27:05,170
家族になればいいよ
It's fine if we become family.

298
00:27:05,170 --> 00:27:08,110
まあ それはそれでいいかも ずれないね
Well, that might be fine too. Never changes, huh.

299
00:27:08,110 --> 00:27:15,410
おっと ということで まあせっかくなんでね ちょっと撮影もね したいなと思ってまして ね このお城バックにちょっと二人で
Anyway, since we have the chance, we'd like to take some photos too. With this castle in the background, the two of us...

300
00:27:15,410 --> 00:27:19,150
しかもねブルーじゃーニーズですしね
Plus, it's Blue Journey too.

301
00:27:19,150 --> 00:27:22,870
そうそうそう ということで じゃあちょっと可愛い写真を撮りましょうか
So, let's take some cute photos.

302
00:27:22,870 --> 00:27:25,470
写真で イエーイ イエーイ
With photos, yay, yay!

303
00:27:25,470 --> 00:27:27,990
どうかな? イエーイ ぴぴきゅーん
How is it? Yay, pipikyūn.

304
00:27:27,990 --> 00:27:33,750
きゅんきゅんきゅんきゅん 皆さん撮ってますか 染めてくれるかな?
Kyunkyunkyunkyun. Are you guys taking pictures? Will you dye us?

305
00:27:33,750 --> 00:27:41,310
あ 染めてくれるかな? 難しいな なんか黄緑に染まるよ どうかな? あとなんかポーズないかな?
Ah, will you dye us? It's hard, somehow dyeing into yellowish-green. How is it? Are there any other poses?

306
00:27:41,310 --> 00:27:46,150
みんな ポーズもいいかないや もうなんかもう全て持ってかれて
Everyone, any good poses? No, wait, everything's been taken away.

307
00:27:46,150 --> 00:27:51,330
白髪みのその曲 持ってかれて 記憶がねツツウラウラで
Shirakami's song got taken away. Memories are all over the place.

308
00:27:51,330 --> 00:27:55,930
じゃ これこうしよっく これあいね あ なんか手手は?
Well then, let's do this. This is "Ai". Ah, what about hands?

309
00:27:55,930 --> 00:28:00,310
どっちを選ぶみたいな そういう 君はどっちを選ぶんだい?
Which one will you choose? Which one will you choose?

310
00:28:00,310 --> 00:28:08,045
どっちを選ぶんだい? どっちも持っている
Which one will you choose? I have both.

311
00:28:08,045 --> 00:28:11,110
贅沢ものね 二人とも贅沢ものね
You're greedy. Both of you are greedy.

312
00:28:11,110 --> 00:28:22,030
ハート ハート こ こう こう これ やっぱこれになるよね これになっちゃうね
Heart. Heart. L-like this. Like this. This. It always ends up like this. It really does.

313
00:28:22,030 --> 00:28:26,030
いや もう可愛いの本当にとれた? これで大丈夫ですか?
Man, did we really get cute ones? Is this okay?

314
00:28:26,030 --> 00:28:28,130
逆バージョンもやった ほら
We did the reverse version too, look.

315
00:28:28,130 --> 00:28:31,530
白髪みはこうやって あきちゃんは
Shirakami like this, Aki-chan like this.

316
00:28:31,530 --> 00:28:36,310
カナジイ カナジイ
So sad. So sad.

317
00:28:36,310 --> 00:28:42,110
これがやはり正解なのかも知れない 正解なのかもな 伝統芸能か
This might actually be the correct answer. Might be the correct answer. Traditional performing arts, huh.

318
00:28:42,110 --> 00:28:49,030
ね あ ということで はいみな撮ってくれましたかね 撮った方もぜひぜひいっぱい詰め寄ってください
Right. So, did everyone take pictures? Those who did, please come closer.

319
00:28:49,030 --> 00:28:58,390
いっぱい盛り上げてくれると嬉しいです それでは次は え 4人でまた歌う曲となっておりますので ちょっと向こうの後ろに
I'd be happy if you hype it up a lot. Next up, we have another song for the four of us, so let's head over to the back over there...

320
00:28:58,390 --> 00:29:00,190
行って 引こうかと思いまーす!
...go and retreat, I think!

321
00:29:00,190 --> 00:29:01,310
みんなで後ろに レッツゴー!
Everyone to the back, let's go!

322
00:29:01,310 --> 00:29:04,990
わーい! 帰ろう 帰ろう 次何だっけかな?
Yay! Let's go back. What was next again?

323
00:29:22,940 --> 00:29:27,100
FEVER!!

324
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:34,960
おいで!おいで! 誘惑のDance again
Come on in! Come on in! Won’t you dance with me again?

325
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:38,000
おいでよ おいで! 輝夜の城へ
Leave behind the things you fear - Kaguya’s castle is near

326
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:40,380
出逢いが彩る ミステリー
An evening here will end in a mystery,

327
00:29:40,380 --> 00:29:42,680
危険なペルソナ (助けて~)
A dangerous persona (Help me~)

328
00:29:42,680 --> 00:29:45,040
踊ろう!踊ろう! 終わらないDance beat
Come and dance! Come and dance, to this beat that never ends!

329
00:29:45,040 --> 00:29:47,400
踊ろうよ 踊ろう! 輝夜の城で
Join in if you know the steps, at Kaguya’s castle dance

330
00:29:47,560 --> 00:29:50,880
夜空を切りとる レーザービーム
The lights up in the sky are like laser beams,

331
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:52,380
私と見てよ? (にゃー?)
So won’t you stay and watch with me? (Meow?)

332
00:29:52,380 --> 00:29:54,920
まばゆい星が照らす想い
Starlight shines upon these feelings, still so strange and new

333
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:57,240
今宵の夢よ 永遠に
Unknown but ever-growing, my love for you

334
00:29:57,240 --> 00:30:01,280
明日のことは忘れたいのに (にこ~)
My sweet dream, don’t leave me (Smile~)

335
00:30:01,560 --> 00:30:05,245
私は赤い薔薇の姫よ
I’m the princess of roses, this moment’s scarlet toned

336
00:30:06,162 --> 00:30:08,462
今宵の夢よ永遠に
May tonight's dream last forever

337
00:30:09,162 --> 00:30:15,362
明日のことは忘れたいの
I want to forget about tomorrow.

338
00:30:17,062 --> 00:30:20,562
私は紅い 薔薇の姫よ
I am the princess of crimson roses,

339
00:30:21,062 --> 00:30:24,262
優しくさらわれたい
wanting to be gently swept away.

340
00:30:25,062 --> 00:30:27,562
そっと囁いて
Whisper softly to me,

341
00:30:27,862 --> 00:30:30,862
意味ありげに目をそらす
and look away with a meaningful gaze.

342
00:30:31,062 --> 00:30:35,062
あなたは白い 月の騎士
You are the knight of the white moon.

343
00:30:35,862 --> 00:30:38,662
触れた手がまだ熱い
The hand that touched me is still warm,

344
00:30:39,262 --> 00:30:42,562
のがさずに抱きしめて
hold me tight without letting go.

345
00:30:43,662 --> 00:30:49,262
この奇跡を 恋と呼ぶのね
So this miracle is what we call love.

346
00:30:56,062 --> 00:31:03,262
おいで おいで 情熱でダンスゲン おいでよ おいで かぐやの白へ
Come on, come on, dance with passion! Come on, to Kaguya's white realm!

347
00:31:03,862 --> 00:31:06,562
迷い込む アンナンシー
Straying into the labyrinth...

348
00:31:07,062 --> 00:31:09,862
でも愛の 場所ねぇ
Yet, where is love?

349
00:31:10,262 --> 00:31:17,562
踊ろう 踊ろう 止まらない遊び おいでよ おいで かぐやの白で
Let's dance, let's dance in endless play! Come on, in Kaguya's white realm!

350
00:31:17,862 --> 00:31:21,562
静寂が織りなす ピカピカは
The sparkling weave of silence...

351
00:31:22,062 --> 00:31:24,862
私を 待ってて
Wait for me.

352
00:31:25,062 --> 00:31:31,562
きらめく星に誓う心 儚い夢でいいわ
A heart swearing to the glittering stars, a fleeting dream is fine.

353
00:31:32,062 --> 00:31:39,262
明日は明日の風が吹くの
Tomorrow's wind will blow tomorrow.

354
00:31:40,562 --> 00:31:44,262
私は 黒い 薔薇の姫よ
I am the princess of black roses,

355
00:31:45,062 --> 00:31:48,062
激しくさらわれたい
wanting to be fiercely swept away.

356
00:31:48,562 --> 00:31:51,562
だから微笑んで
So smile at me,

357
00:31:51,862 --> 00:31:54,862
追いかけてと目が誘う
my eyes inviting you to chase me.

358
00:31:55,062 --> 00:31:58,862
あなたも 黒い 月の騎士
You are also the knight of the black moon.

359
00:31:59,062 --> 00:32:02,562
瞳の奥は熱い
The depths of your eyes are burning,

360
00:32:02,862 --> 00:32:06,562
つかまえて抱きしめて
catch me and hold me tight.

361
00:32:07,062 --> 00:32:13,062
この奇跡を 恋と呼ぶのね
So this miracle is what we call love.

362
00:32:20,062 --> 00:32:24,062
一緒にいよ 気づいてよ
Be with me, notice it!

363
00:32:24,562 --> 00:32:29,562
他の人を見ないでよ 私だけを見て
Don't look at anyone else, look only at me!

364
00:32:30,062 --> 00:32:32,562
後悔するわよ
You'll regret it.

365
00:32:33,062 --> 00:32:36,562
楽しもう 早くしなさいよ
Let's have fun, hurry up!

366
00:32:37,062 --> 00:32:42,562
気づいたのですか? いいの?
Did you realize? Is that okay?

367
00:32:43,062 --> 00:32:46,562
私は 赤い 薔薇の姫よ
I am the princess of crimson roses,

368
00:32:47,062 --> 00:32:50,262
優しくさらわれたい
wanting to be gently swept away.

369
00:32:50,562 --> 00:32:53,062
そっと囁いて
Whisper softly to me,

370
00:32:53,562 --> 00:32:56,562
意味ありげに目をそらす
and look away with a meaningful gaze.

371
00:32:57,062 --> 00:33:00,862
あなたは 白い 月の騎士
You are the knight of the white moon.

372
00:33:01,062 --> 00:33:04,062
触れた手がまだ熱い
The hand that touched me is still warm,

373
00:33:04,562 --> 00:33:07,862
のがさずに抱きしめて
hold me tight without letting go.

374
00:33:08,062 --> 00:33:14,562
この奇跡を 恋と呼ぶのね
So this miracle is what we call love.

375
00:33:58,062 --> 00:34:01,562
君を泣かすから だから一緒には居れないな
Because I'll make you cry, that's why we can't be together.

376
00:34:02,062 --> 00:34:06,062
君を泣かすから 早く忘れて欲しいんだ
Because I'll make you cry, I want you to forget me quickly.

377
00:34:07,062 --> 00:34:11,562
人間だからね たまには違うものも食べたいね
We're human, after all, so sometimes we want to eat something different.

378
00:34:12,062 --> 00:34:15,562
君を泣かすから そう君を泣かすから
Because I'll make you cry, yes, because I'll make you cry.

379
00:34:16,062 --> 00:34:24,062
でも味気ないんだよね 会いたいなんだよね
Yet it's so bland... I want to see you.

380
00:34:26,062 --> 00:34:30,062
大体曖昧なんだよね 愛の存在証明なんて
It's all so vague, like proof that love exists.

381
00:34:30,562 --> 00:34:34,062
君が教えてくれないから
Since you won't teach me.

382
00:34:34,562 --> 00:34:43,062
何十回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような愛してるを並べてみて
Try lining up "I love you"s that you could never get even spending tens of nights...

383
00:34:44,062 --> 00:34:53,562
何十回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような最高のフルコースを頂戴
Give me the ultimate full course meal that you could never get even spending tens of nights!

384
