Hey, we'd like to premiere this song for you right after this!

731
01:01:22,669 --> 01:01:26,669
はい、楽曲の配信もですね、この後24時から配信開始！
Yes, the song release will also start at midnight right after this!

732
01:01:27,169 --> 01:01:32,669
そしてね、ずっとホロライブの公式チャンネルでねハテナハテナがあったと思うんですけど
And also, I think there were question marks on Hololive's official channel the whole time.

733
01:01:32,669 --> 01:01:36,169
こちらですね、22時15分からこちらの「Secret Garden」のMV公開です！
And here, the MV release for 'Secret Garden' is from 22:15!

734
01:01:36,669 --> 01:01:46,169
これもなんか良い感じにね、本当にになっておりますのでぜひぜひよろしくお願いいたします！
This is also shaping up to be really nice, so please check it out!

735
01:01:46,669 --> 01:01:50,169
ちょっと新曲ってドキドキするね、ドキドキするね
New songs make you nervous, don't they? So nervous.

736
01:01:50,169 --> 01:02:01,169
よし、ということでじゃあ、6周年を締めくくる、ちょっとね、オリ曲やるぞ、やっとか、できるかな？
Alright, with that, let's wrap up our 6th anniversary with our original song. Can we do it?

737
01:02:01,169 --> 01:02:05,169
よっしゃ！6周年、そして7周年も頑張るぞ！おー！
Alright! Let's do our best for the 6th and 7th anniversaries! Oh!

738
01:02:05,169 --> 01:02:10,169
ちょっとみんな立ち位置覚えてるか？まあさすがに何回も練習したから覚えているよ
Do you all remember your positions? Well, we practiced many times so we remember.

739
01:02:10,169 --> 01:02:12,169
最後の曲だ！
It's the final song!

740
01:02:12,169 --> 01:02:18,669
よし、じゃあみんな全部やりいいですか？はい！いきますよー！せーの！Secret Garden！
Alright, is everyone ready? Yes! Here we go! Ready, set! Secret Garden!

741
01:02:41,669 --> 01:02:44,369
月夜のセレナーデ
Serenade of the moonlit night

742
01:02:44,969 --> 01:02:48,169
白い薔薇は誰を想う
Whom does the white rose yearn for?

743
01:02:48,369 --> 01:02:51,169
その身を震わせて
Shivering its body,

744
01:02:51,369 --> 01:02:54,669
愛を歌うの
Singing of love.

745
01:02:55,969 --> 01:02:59,969
零れ落ちた花びらが
The scattered flower petals

746
01:03:00,169 --> 01:03:03,169
寂しさの跡を隠した
Hid the traces of loneliness.

747
01:03:03,669 --> 01:03:06,969
ねえ早く迎えに来て
Hey, come and welcome me soon,

748
01:03:06,969 --> 01:03:11,669
最後のひとひらが落ちるその前に
Before the last petal falls.

749
01:03:12,969 --> 01:03:16,669
今はどんな花とも群れないの
Now, I don't flock with any other flowers,

750
01:03:16,669 --> 01:03:20,169
あなただけを待ってる
Waiting only for you.

751
01:03:20,169 --> 01:03:26,669
あなたとならこの体が壊されたってもう構わない
With you, I wouldn't care even if this body were broken.

752
01:03:27,969 --> 01:03:30,969
棘に触れたら傷つくわ
If you touch the thorns, you'll get hurt.

753
01:03:31,169 --> 01:03:37,169
その覚悟がないならいっそここから消えてよ
If you don't have that resolve, then get lost from here.

754
01:03:38,169 --> 01:03:42,669
重く閉ざした そう Secret Garden
The heavily closed... yes, Secret Garden.

755
01:03:48,169 --> 01:03:51,169
夜風はリゾルート
The night wind is resolute,

756
01:03:51,169 --> 01:03:55,169
白い薔薇は覚醒する
The white rose awakens.

757
01:03:55,369 --> 01:04:01,969
背中押されるように扉開いた
As if pushed from behind, the door opened.

758
01:04:02,669 --> 01:04:09,669
ただ独りで枯れてゆくの？待ってるだけじゃいられない
Will I just wither away alone? I can't just keep waiting.

759
01:04:09,969 --> 01:04:18,969
衝動の赴くまま 茨の道を裸足で駆け抜けてく
Following my impulses, I run barefoot down the thorny path.

760
01:04:19,669 --> 01:04:23,969
凛と咲き誇る華でありたい
I want to be a flower blooming proudly and gracefully,

761
01:04:24,169 --> 01:04:28,169
あなただけを求めて
Seeking only you.

762
01:04:28,169 --> 01:04:34,169
逢いにゆくの どんな遠く離れていても見つけ出せる
I'm going to meet you, no matter how far apart we are, I can find you.

763
01:04:34,969 --> 01:04:40,669
暗い世界も怖くない あなたを感じるから
I'm not afraid of a dark world either, because I feel you.

764
01:04:41,169 --> 01:04:50,169
全て失ったっていい 二度と戻らない そう Secret Garden
It's fine if I lose everything, never to return, yes, Secret Garden.

765
01:05:18,078 --> 01:05:21,843
今は どんな花とも群れないの
Now, I won't flock with any other flowers,

766
01:05:22,288 --> 01:05:25,488
あなただけを求めて
seeking only you.

767
01:05:25,988 --> 01:05:29,188
霞の向こう 私を呼ぶ
Beyond the haze, someone is calling me.

768
01:05:29,488 --> 01:05:33,988
鮮やかに燃える強き薔薇
A strong rose burning vividly.

769
01:05:35,188 --> 01:05:39,388
凛と 咲き誇る華でありたい
I want to be a flower blooming proudly.

770
01:05:39,488 --> 01:05:42,788
やっとここで出逢えた
We finally met here.

771
01:05:43,188 --> 01:05:46,388
あなたとならこの体が
If it's with you, even if this body...

772
01:05:46,688 --> 01:05:49,788
壊されたってもう構わない
...is broken, I don't care anymore.

773
01:05:50,388 --> 01:05:53,188
棘に触れたら傷つくわ
Touching thorns will hurt you.

774
01:05:53,488 --> 01:05:56,788
その覚悟があるのね
Do you have that resolve?

775
01:05:56,988 --> 01:06:00,188
手を取り合えばひろがる
If we hold hands, it spreads outward—

776
01:06:00,388 --> 01:06:02,688
誰も知らない そう
a place nobody knows, yes...

777
01:06:02,788 --> 01:06:06,688
Sacred Universe

